OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,FPC Andrew Harper's mother, Debbie
OL,7,FAdlam, has now issued a challenge to
OL,8,Fthe Prime Minister, Andy Burnham, to
OL,9,Fcome and meet her
OL,11,FThe mother of PC Andrew Harper has
OL,12,Fcalled on the prime minister to meet
OL,13,Fher face-to-face to explain his
OL,14,Fgovernment's position that it would
OL,15,Fnot be possible to exempt her son's
OL,16,Fkillers from the early release scheme.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
