OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786396755
OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,FDebbie Adlam told ITV News she is
OL,7,F"more angry than ever" that the
OL,8,Fgovernment has resisted pressure to
OL,9,Fkeep her son's killers, Jessie Cole
OL,10,Fand Albert Bowers, behind bars.
OL,12,FDowning Street said on Monday it is
OL,13,F"not possible" to exempt "one or two
OL,14,Foffenders" convicted of manslaughter
OL,15,Ffrom its early release scheme, which
OL,16,Faims to free up space in prisons.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
