OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786396755
OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,FMs Adlam, who was asked what she would
OL,7,Flike to say to Andy Burnham, said:
OL,8,F"You want to tour the country, you
OL,9,Fwant to meet the people - you haven't
OL,10,Feven got in touch with me.
OL,12,F"How about coming to see me?
OL,14,FPC Harper, 28, was fatally injured in
OL,15,F2019 when he became caught in a strap
OL,16,Fattached to the back of a car while
OL,17,Fresponding to a quad bike theft in
OL,18,FSulhamstead, Berkshire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
