PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786396755
OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,FHe was dragged along a country road as
OL,7,Fthree teenage suspects, including Cole
OL,8,Fand Bowers, fled the scene of the
OL,9,Fburglary.
OL,11,FThey were found guilty of manslaughter
OL,12,Fover Harper's death and sentenced to
OL,13,F13 years in prison in 2020, but under
OL,14,Fcurrent plans, they remain eligible to
OL,15,Fbe freed in January, halfway through
OL,16,Ftheir sentences.
OL,18,FThe driver of the vehicle, Henry Long,
OL,19,Freceived a 16-year sentence and would
OL,20,Fnot be eligible for release.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786396755
OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,F"Nobody has been in touch, officially,
OL,7,Fto tell me what the situation is. I've
OL,8,Fheard nothing from the government," Ms
OL,9,FAdlam told ITV News.
OL,11,F"I'm just really angry now because our
OL,12,Femotions are going round... we're
OL,13,Fgetting twisted inside, with what is
OL,14,Fhappening.
OL,16,F"My life's on hold while this is going
OL,17,Fon. I've got to try and hold
OL,18,Feverything else together."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
