OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FA government spokesperson said on
OL,12,FMonday: "I think you've seen from the
OL,13,FPrime Minister's words that he's far
OL,14,Ffrom accepting the situation and as he
OL,15,Fwrote last week he wants to go even
OL,16,Ffurther.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786396755
OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,F"He's pushed hard on what more we
OL,7,Fcould do and his focus now is on
OL,8,Ffixing the prison system long term to
OL,9,Favoid a repeat of this prison crisis
OL,10,Fso that it never happens again."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786396755
OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,FPressed on whether the prime minister
OL,7,Fwas admitting there was nothing more
OL,8,Fhe could do, the official said: "He
OL,9,Funderstands the public wants him to go
OL,10,Ffurther, and he wanted to go further,
OL,11,Fbut on the wider issue that prisons
OL,12,Fwould have run out of space, police
OL,13,Fwould stop making arrests, it would be
OL,14,Fimpossible to lock up convicted
OL,15,Foffenders and that would put public
OL,16,Fsafety at untold risk."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
