OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786396755
OL,3,C'More angry than ever': Mother of PC
OL,4,CHarper calls for Burnham meeting
OL,6,FThe early release changes were part of
OL,7,Fthe Sentencing Act passed earlier this
OL,8,Fyear that cut the minimum amount of
OL,9,Ftime many offenders would have to
OL,10,Fspend in prison.
OL,12,FThose freed will face tougher
OL,13,Fprobation conditions, including
OL,14,Felectronic monitoring, random drug
OL,15,Ftesting and possible bans from
OL,16,Fdriving, pubs and events such as
OL,17,Ffootball matches.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
